! Be you a traveler who frequents these trails?","nextNodeIds":[733380102]},{"nodeId":733380102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":2177140570,"text":"Apologies for halting you halfway along your path but... Um, could you enlighten me as to the events that transpired here?","nextNodeIds":[733380103]},{"nodeId":733380103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":567530770,"text":"#I'm {NICKNAME}. Pleased to meet you.","nextNodeIds":[733380104]},{"nodeId":733380104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":3268791322,"text":"Tanjiyy, Vahumana Dastur, at your service. I came here to provide... educational assistance to the... Ah, yes, the Tanit.","nextNodeIds":[733380105]},{"nodeId":733380105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":794884346,"text":"This whole affair is most odd. This should be the right place, but... Oh, how did things turn like this...","nextNodeIds":[733380106,733380108]},{"nodeId":733380106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":258856522,"text":"It's... a long story.","nextNodeIds":[733380107]},{"nodeId":733380107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":3625436418,"text":"Could be tribal warfare, or some kind of internal conflict, hm? Very interesting. It's been centuries since a conflict occurred in these sands that saw an entire tribe annihilated.","nextNodeIds":[733380110]},{"nodeId":733380110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":166195922,"text":"Additionally, I discovered signs that I found most... ominous. I recommend against checking yourself. It's... revolting, and will likely make you retch.","nextNodeIds":[733380111]},{"nodeId":733380111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":1271875258,"text":"Perhaps it might have been the work of survivors among them — survivors who later returned to gather most of the... abandoned belongings. Alas, I cannot be sure. Either way, it was a highly disquieting scene.","nextNodeIds":[733380112]},{"nodeId":733380112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2460224858,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[733380113]},{"nodeId":733380113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":3422472082,"text":"*sigh* How did I encounter something like this? I feel like I've witnessed an event that'll make into the history books...","nextNodeIds":[733380114]},{"nodeId":733380114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":288005514,"text":"Ahem. Anyway... would you like to play cards?","nextNodeIds":[733380115]},{"nodeId":733380115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":3382655218,"text":"I found a few decks in those tents, and they're still in a decent state — after some cleaning, that is. If you're interested, perhaps we could have a game or two...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":733380108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1712722242,"text":"Maybe they... migrated.","nextNodeIds":[733380109]},{"nodeId":733380109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4437,"speakerName":"Tanjiyy","textMapHash":141860346,"text":"Migrated? No. Look, the supplies and the tents are right where they used to be. There's ash and signs of former habitation everywhere... Hm. Honestly, it's more like a great disaster swept through suddenly and upended all their lives.","nextNodeIds":[733380110]}]},{"talkId":7333808,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["",